          "text": "Substance: Egg white · Treatment: Dip the test end of Albustix paper into the sample · Result: The test end would turn green."
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "Substance: Peanut oil · Treatment: Grease spot test · Result: A translucent spot would form on the filter paper, which would disappear after drying."
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "Substance: Starch solution · Treatment: Benedict’s test · Result: Brick-red precipitate would form."
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "Substance: Glucose solution · Treatment: Mix with iodine solution · Result: The mixture would turn blue-black."
